{"unit_id":"MoonGlassKitty__dsh-tailscale-sync#card-zh","repo":"MoonGlassKitty/dsh-tailscale-sync","commit":"bb54ac93063bebb4f17147a94b64ab0a6ca901b3","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-tailscale-sync 是面向 DSH Web 和手机浏览器的远程访问插件。它通过补丁把 DSH Web 服务绑定到本机回环地址，并根据本机 Tailscale 状态自动发现设备的 ts.net 域名，将该域名加入 API 受信主机配置。配合电脑上运行的 Tailscale Serve，用户可在手机上打开同一台电脑的 DSH 界面和会话。适合希望在手机浏览器继续使用电脑端 DSH 的用户；需要电脑和手机登录 Tailscale，并在电脑运行一次 tailscale serve 命令。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:10-17","README.md:14-47"]}
{"unit_id":"MoonGlassKitty__dsh-tailscale-sync#card-en","repo":"MoonGlassKitty/dsh-tailscale-sync","commit":"bb54ac93063bebb4f17147a94b64ab0a6ca901b3","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-tailscale-sync lets a phone browser access a computer's DSH web interface. Its patch binds the server to loopback and discovers the computer's ts.net name through Tailscale status. Start Tailscale Serve on the computer to open the same DSH session from a phone. Both devices need Tailscale.","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:10-17","README.md:14-47"]}
